---
import SectionLayout from '../layouts/SectionLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/site';
---
<SectionLayout section="all" mastheadTitle="403" title="这卷还没对你打开">
  <div class="status-page">
    <p>这卷还没对你打开。</p>
    <p>如果你觉得自己应该有权限看到它，去对应相册页面底部留一句话申请，或者先去登录看看能解锁多少。</p>
    <p><a href={withBase('/login')}>友邻登录 →</a> · <a href={withBase('/photos')}>回到相册列表 →</a></p>
  </div>
</SectionLayout>
